# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lumina AI — environment configuration
#
# ⚠️  OPTIONAL. The app works 100% for free with the Pollinations (FLUX) engine
#     with NO key at all. You can also paste keys directly in the app's
#     "API Keys" settings panel (stored only in your browser).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in what you need:
#     cp .env.example .env.local
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Gemini API key — FREE, no credit card required:
#   1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   2. Sign in with a Google account → "Create API key"
# Unlocks: Gemini image engine, AI prompt enhancement, AI image upscale.
# (Image quota on the free tier depends on Google's current per-project limits.)
#
# This value is inlined at build time by Vite's `define`, so restart `npm run dev`
# after editing this file. A key saved in the in-app panel takes priority over it.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
